# Rust
**/target/

# Node
**/node_modules/
**/dist/

# Model weights — hundreds of megabytes each, downloaded at runtime and never committed.
# This is the anti-bloat charter applied to the repo itself (PRD §1).
models/
*.bin
*.onnx
*.onnx.data
*.partial

# M0 spike artefacts. Patterns are unanchored, so they keep matching after the move to research/.
**/m0-bench/audio/
**/m0-bench/cache/
**/m0-bench/M0-RESULTS.md
**/m0-tcc/build/

# Local UI captures from Playwright. Useful while iterating on the settings window, never worth
# committing — the icons and anything referenced by the README are allowed back in below.
*.png
!public/*.png
!src-tauri/icons/**/*.png
!docs/images/*.png
.playwright-mcp/
screenshots/

# `tauri icon` emits Android and iOS icon sets from the same source. This is a desktop app, so
# they are 35 files of noise — regenerate them if a mobile target ever appears.
src-tauri/icons/android/
src-tauri/icons/ios/

# Private working notes. Kept out of the repo deliberately — nothing in the codebase or the
# public docs refers to it, so its absence breaks nothing.
docs/PRD.md

# macOS
.DS_Store
